[TITLE]
Column-and-precision fixture for the file-IO parity audit.

Every value below is chosen so that a dropped column, a shifted column or a
truncating format is unambiguous in generation 1:

  * the divider tails carry four DISTINCT values, so reading MaxDepth from the
    InitDepth column (the old OVERFLOW off-by-one) shows up as 1.11 not 6.07;
  * C_CULVERT carries culvert code 4, which used to vanish because the writer
    stopped at the Barrels column;
  * S1's area has nine significant digits, which %12.4f truncated to 0.0189 —
    a 0.2% error straight into runoff volume;
  * ST1's functional A1 has nine, which a bare %g truncated to 278.54;
  * C_SEEP's seepage is in in/hr and this deck is CFS, so it exercises the
    UCF(RAINFALL) back-conversion the LENGTH-only writer gate used to skip;
  * MINIMUM_STEP is a WHOLE number of seconds on purpose — fmt_step only
    produced the fatal "0:00:01" clock form for whole-second values, so a
    fractional 0.5 here would let the defect through the gate unnoticed.

Units are CFS deliberately: the unit defects only bite US decks.

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
INFILTRATION         HORTON
FLOW_ROUTING         DYNWAVE
LINK_OFFSETS         DEPTH
START_DATE           01/01/2024
END_DATE             01/01/2024
REPORT_STEP          00:15:00
ROUTING_STEP         00:00:30
MINIMUM_STEP         1
ALLOW_PONDING        YES

[RAINGAGES]
;;Name  Format     Interval  SCF   Source
RG1     INTENSITY  0:05      1.0   TIMESERIES TS1

[TIMESERIES]
TS1  0:00  0.0
TS1  1:00  0.5

[SUBCATCHMENTS]
;;Name  RainGage  Outlet  Area         %Imperv  Width  %Slope  CurbLen
S1      RG1       J1      0.018939394  25.0     100.0  0.5     0

[SUBAREAS]
;;Subcatch  N-Imperv  N-Perv  S-Imperv  S-Perv  PctZero  RouteTo
S1          0.013     0.1     0.05      0.05    25       OUTLET

[INFILTRATION]
;;Subcatch  MaxRate  MinRate  Decay  DryTime  MaxInfil
S1          3.0      0.5      4.0    7        0

[JUNCTIONS]
;;Name  Elev   MaxDepth  InitDepth  SurDepth  Aponded
J1      100.0  10.0      0.0        0.0       0.0
J2      98.0   10.0      0.0        0.0       0.0
J3      96.0   10.0      0.0        0.0       0.0

[DIVIDERS]
;;Name  Elev  DivLink  Type      (Params)  MaxDepth  InitDepth  SurDepth  Aponded
DIV_OVR 95.0  L_DIV    OVERFLOW            6.07      1.11       2.22      200.0
DIV_CUT 94.0  L_DIV2   CUTOFF    3.33      7.07      1.12       2.23      300.0

[STORAGE]
;;Name  Elev  MaxDepth  InitDepth  Shape       A1          A2  A0  SurDepth  Fevap
ST1     93.0  22.0      1.0        FUNCTIONAL  278.539816  0   0   0         0

[OUTFALLS]
;;Name  Elev  Type  Stage  Gated
O1      90.0  FREE         NO
O2      90.0  FREE         NO
O3      90.0  FREE         NO

[CONDUITS]
;;Name    From     To       Length  Rough  InOff  OutOff
C_CULVERT J1       J2       100.0   0.013  0      0
C_SEEP    J2       J3       120.5   0.013  0      0
C_IN      J3       DIV_OVR  100.0   0.013  0      0
L_DIV     DIV_OVR  O1       100.0   0.013  0      0
C_MID     DIV_OVR  DIV_CUT  100.0   0.013  0      0
L_DIV2    DIV_CUT  O2       100.0   0.013  0      0
C_MAIN    DIV_CUT  ST1      100.0   0.013  0      0
C_OUT     ST1      O3       100.0   0.013  0      0

[XSECTIONS]
;;Link     Shape     Geom1  Geom2  Geom3  Geom4  Barrels  Culvert
C_CULVERT  CIRCULAR  1.5    0      0      0      1        4
C_SEEP     CIRCULAR  1.5    0      0      0      1
C_IN       CIRCULAR  1.5    0      0      0      1
L_DIV      CIRCULAR  1.0    0      0      0      1
C_MID      CIRCULAR  1.5    0      0      0      1
L_DIV2     CIRCULAR  1.0    0      0      0      1
C_MAIN     CIRCULAR  1.5    0      0      0      1
C_OUT      CIRCULAR  1.5    0      0      0      1

[LOSSES]
;;Link   Kentry  Kexit  Kavg  Flap  Seepage
C_SEEP   0       0      0     NO    0.25

[COORDINATES]
J1       0    0
J2       100  0
J3       200  0
DIV_OVR  300  0
DIV_CUT  400  0
ST1      500  0
O1       300  100
O2       400  100
O3       600  0

[Polygons]
S1  0  0
S1  0  50
S1  50 50
